  "properties": {
    "title": "Climate station data (NHMS synoptic stations)",
    "description": "Daily weather data for three synoptic stations in and around the N'Zi watershed, served by AfricaRice's ARCWeather portal: Bouaké and Ferkessédougou from 1980 to 2010, Korhogo from 1994 to 2001. Korhogo holds fewer variables, and its dew point is estimated from the minimum temperature. AfricaRice's own M'Bé research-station data from 2014 onward is a separate record, MFL-2026-084.",
